WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:08.010
SCP-682 was once at the mercy of the liminal
abyss known as the backrooms, but now the

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:12.210
hard to destroy reptile has become a master
of the backrooms.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:17.260
After absorbing the essence of the Skeleton
Queen, along with several other powerful Backrooms

00:00:17.260 --> 00:00:25.029
entities, SCP-682 had become powerful enough
to create its own level of the Backrooms - Level

00:00:25.029 --> 00:00:26.260
682.

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:32.000
If you can’t beat the backrooms, become
the backrooms.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.910
In its latest adapted form, 682 was able to
command the lesser entities of the backrooms,

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:41.000
such as clumps, death moths, and hounds.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.090
These entities were now at the beck and call
of 682, and could be deployed at a moment’s

00:00:46.090 --> 00:00:49.989
notice to savage trespassers on 682’s level.

00:00:49.989 --> 00:00:54.000
While it was nearly unfathomable to believe
that any human explorer could survive the

00:00:54.000 --> 00:01:00.180
long journey from Level 0 to Level 682, challengers
would soon arrive to attempt to snatch the

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:04.000
proverbial crown from 682’s reptilian head.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.020
The death of the Skeleton Queen had upset
the balance of the backrooms, and now there

00:01:09.020 --> 00:01:14.100
were countless other supernatural beings that
wanted a taste of the scrappy newcomer.

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:19.970
The first two warriors to arrive were the
infamous spear-using humanoids - Entity 74

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:23.570
“Argos” and Entity 720 “Tiny”.

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:29.340
Other than a shared weapon of choice and a
mutual hatred for SCP-682, these two entities

00:01:29.340 --> 00:01:30.990
had little in common.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.649
But the sting of their previous defeats at
the claws of their hated rival had compelled

00:01:35.649 --> 00:01:41.610
the two to make their way to Level 682 and
face the lizard once more.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:47.160
Argos bellowed as he entered into the devastated
wasteland of Level 682.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:51.579
He had appeared first, accompanied by his
specially-trained retinue of human soldiers

00:01:51.579 --> 00:01:55.310
in tactical gear - The Eyes of Argos.

00:01:55.310 --> 00:02:00.549
Each one wielded a lesser replica of their
immortal leader’s signature spear, and all

00:02:00.549 --> 00:02:02.300
were ready for battle.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:07.540
Faced with these intruders, all SCP-682 could
do was laugh wickedly.

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:13.330
Its own army of hostile entities stood at
attention, leering at the humans.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:17.280
“Entity 74 - Argos.”

00:02:17.280 --> 00:02:19.930
SCP-682 greeted its visitor.

00:02:19.930 --> 00:02:26.989
“Even without eyes in that swollen head
of yours, you must see that you cannot win

00:02:26.989 --> 00:02:28.269
this.”

00:02:28.269 --> 00:02:33.099
Argos roared that 682 was a sinner, and his
judgment was here.

00:02:33.099 --> 00:02:38.930
Argos pointed his spear, and the Eyes of Argos
charged towards 682, who - in-turn - raised

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:43.950
a claw and signaled its own forces to meet
the Eyes on the field of combat.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:48.269
Level 682 of the Backrooms was now a battlefield!

00:02:48.269 --> 00:02:52.330
Human soldiers and entities were clashing
in pitched warfare.

00:02:52.330 --> 00:02:56.209
Argos broke through the front lines and turned
his spear on 682.

00:02:56.209 --> 00:03:00.739
The reptile merely grinned through all of
its teeth as Argos’ spear was deflected

00:03:00.739 --> 00:03:02.970
effortlessly off its hide.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:08.970
Argos struck again and again, but it seemed
that the eyeless giant had totally underestimated

00:03:08.970 --> 00:03:10.950
682’s new form.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:14.909
This was not going to be the same fight as
the previous time the two had met, with the

00:03:14.909 --> 00:03:20.080
level of strength that the reptile had amassed,
it might not even be anything that could be

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:21.710
considered a fight.

00:03:21.710 --> 00:03:25.050
At least, not if it remained a one-on-one
battle.

00:03:25.050 --> 00:03:30.099
Fortunately for Argos, the other of the Backrooms
spear duo was about to make a splash.

00:03:30.099 --> 00:03:31.099
Literally.

00:03:31.099 --> 00:03:37.930
A gateway to Level 7 - the endless ocean - opened
above the battlefield, causing an untold quantity

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.650
of water to flow into the war zone of Level
682.

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:41.650
The gargantuan and grossly misnamed Tiny descended
through the portal, swimming through the stream

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:42.650
towards SCP-682.

00:03:42.650 --> 00:03:47.689
It was chaos as both Argos and 682’s minions
were swept up in the current and drowned out.

00:03:47.689 --> 00:03:52.329
Argos was frustrated at the sudden loss of
his army, but 682 couldn’t care less about

00:03:52.329 --> 00:03:56.580
what happened to the Backrooms entities that
had temporarily bought themselves a bit more

00:03:56.580 --> 00:04:01.470
time in existence by pledging loyalty to their
reptile master.

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:07.299
It was, after all, only a matter of time before
682 had gotten sick of them and destroyed

00:04:07.299 --> 00:04:09.880
the miserable entities on a whim.

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:12.099
Serious contenders only.

00:04:12.099 --> 00:04:14.989
“Your entrance was sinful.”

00:04:14.989 --> 00:04:18.860
Argos spat towards Tiny, as the rushing water
submerged him.

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:21.959
“My entrance, like everything I do, was
perfect.”

00:04:21.959 --> 00:04:22.959
Tiny scoffed.

00:04:22.959 --> 00:04:28.150
“Now are you going to aid in my revenge
against this loathsome beast or are you going

00:04:28.150 --> 00:04:31.020
to be sanctimonious as usual?”

00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:36.000
The spear duo acknowledged each other, and,
putting aside their differences in a temporary

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:41.880
alliance, dove for 682 in an attempt to overwhelm
the hard-to-destroy reptile.

00:04:41.880 --> 00:04:47.620
The tips of both spears collided with 682
and managed to push the creature a short distance

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:50.930
across the now-submerged landscape of its
level.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:56.620
In retaliation, 682 trades its claws for a
number of flexible tentacles that were able

00:04:56.620 --> 00:05:01.259
to push off the ground and propel the Level
master towards its two adversaries.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:07.030
It grappled Argos with its long, flexible
arms and swung him against the solid surface

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:08.270
of the ground.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:13.020
The eyeless warrior countered by stabbing
one of 682’s tentacles, but the clever reptile

00:05:13.020 --> 00:05:16.740
shed the tentacle immediately and jettisoned
toward Tiny.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:22.780
The massive humanoid attempted to stab 682,
but was unable to hit his target as his opponent

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:26.800
used its tentacles to grab Tiny’s body and
maneuver around him effortlessly.

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:28.490
In a case of further irony, 682 was using
its smaller size to its advantage against

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:29.490
Tiny.

00:05:29.490 --> 00:05:32.100
Meanwhile, Argos was just now coming to grips
with a disadvantage of its own.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:37.380
While on land, the sin-hunter was quite capable
of sustaining countless injuries and regenerating

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:42.250
from the damage, its respiratory system had
no way to evacuate the water that had not

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.710
begun to fill the humanoid’s lungs.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:48.490
Though he was immortal: Argos was drowning.

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:52.720
Even his unlimited stamina couldn’t prevent
his body from slowing down.

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:58.200
At this moment, both entities were unable
to gain a significant advantage over 682.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:05.270
Moreover, the lack of cohesion between their
tactics was leaving both open to a counterattack.

00:06:05.270 --> 00:06:10.210
This was precisely the kind of opportunity
that 682 had been waiting for.

00:06:10.210 --> 00:06:16.069
While in its prior state, the hard-to-destroy
reptile was only able to adapt its own physique,

00:06:16.069 --> 00:06:20.910
but now that it had become one with a portion
of the backrooms, it had gained the ability

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:23.910
to adapt its level as well.

00:06:23.910 --> 00:06:29.910
In an instant, 682 asserted its control over
its domain and expunged the water from Level

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:33.520
7 back into the liminal nothingness between
levels.

00:06:33.520 --> 00:06:38.600
While Argos could now stand back on solid
ground, it was sluggish and immobilized by

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:40.150
the water in its body.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:44.630
He attempted to gag and force the water out,
but leaving that kind of opening was a time

00:06:44.630 --> 00:06:47.479
that Entity 74 didn’t have.

00:06:47.479 --> 00:06:52.180
Entity 720 came crashing down upon Argos,
smothering the entity beneath its thalassic

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.180
bulk.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.180
While underwater, Tiny was a force to reckoned
with, the entity was incapable of walking

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:55.180
on land.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.180
It was now little more than a beached whale
in the shape of a humanoid giant.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:57.520
Having now immobilized both of its adversaries,
682 was quite proud of itself.

00:06:57.520 --> 00:07:02.650
It whipped at Tiny with its fearsome tentacles,
adding insult to injury with deep wounds across

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:05.370
the giant’s entire form.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:09.639
Spear-carriers don’t belong on the main
stage.

00:07:09.639 --> 00:07:15.050
Drawing from the same wellspring of power
that allowed it to absorb the Skeleton Queen,

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:22.190
SCP-682 devoured the essence of both Entity
74 and Entity 720.

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:28.340
Just like the time before, the hard-to-destroy
reptile went one step further than mere consumption.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:34.900
The reptilian master of dimensions assimilated
and incorporated elements of Level 7 and Level

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:40.139
10 into the exponentially growing borders
of Level 682.

00:07:40.139 --> 00:07:46.069
Now that it was victorious against the two
spear-wielding humanoids, 682 let out a mighty

00:07:46.069 --> 00:07:50.210
roar that echoed throughout all the remaining
levels of the backrooms.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:55.550
The message to all dimensional rulers on every
level was crystal clear - if they didn’t

00:07:55.550 --> 00:08:01.310
come to level 682 to challenge its master,
the reptile would bring the challenge to each

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:03.680
and every one of them.

00:08:03.680 --> 00:08:11.430
I am the Backrooms, and when my kingdom comes,
I will be all there is.

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:17.120
While most of the entities and humans on the
other levels cowered in fear, there were several

00:08:17.120 --> 00:08:19.750
who still wished to stand and fight.

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:25.530
The next opponent that would confront SCP-682
in an attempt to slay the creature was none

00:08:25.530 --> 00:08:28.400
other than the blue knight of level 28.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:35.010
The brightly-shining suit of armor strode
into Level 682, carrying a raging storm behind

00:08:35.010 --> 00:08:36.010
it.

00:08:36.010 --> 00:08:41.959
Hurricane-force winds beat down on 682, followed
by an unforgiving rain of lightning bolts.

00:08:41.959 --> 00:08:45.850
The reptile weathered the storm and struck
back with a vicious bite that crushed the

00:08:45.850 --> 00:08:49.120
armor of the Blue Knight’s arm and part
of his chestplate.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:55.250
Then, 682 turned like a crocodile in a death
roll, inflicting even more damage to the sentient

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:56.250
armor.

00:08:56.250 --> 00:09:01.220
With his free gauntlet, the blue knight pounded
on 682’s head, bringing down even more lightning

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.120
and wind on the reptile.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:04.760
Your storm is weak.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:09.720
I feel disgusting having to use my immense
power to dispel it.

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:14.741
Yet again, 682 manipulated its level of the
Backrooms, causing the storm that the blue

00:09:14.741 --> 00:09:18.920
knight had called to be banished into the
void between levels.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.690
The blue knight was aghast.

00:09:20.690 --> 00:09:26.190
The reason he had always stayed on Level 28
was to spare the humans of more settled levels

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:31.339
from the wrathful storm clouds that he was
known to create in his moments of emotional

00:09:31.339 --> 00:09:32.420
outbursts.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:39.530
It was his most shameful curse, and yet 682
had made it disappear as simply as morning

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:40.530
mist.

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:45.730
The now powerless blue knight could do nothing
as he, too, was devoured by 682.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:49.630
His next words were a plea for a wish that
could never come true.

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:53.640
“I wish I could have seen you one more time,
Sara.”

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:59.250
Like Argos and Tiny before him, The Blue Knight
and his corresponding Level 28 had become

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:01.510
part of 682 now.

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:06.410
682 was starting to get accustomed to the
feeling of devouring levels of the Backrooms.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:12.320
The taste was invigorating, and out of a sense
of malicious initiative, the reptilian entity

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:16.220
went on an unplanned rampage through the surrounding
levels.

00:10:16.220 --> 00:10:22.280
While it was nothing more than a trivial test
of the incredible power at its disposal, 682

00:10:22.280 --> 00:10:27.800
was able to drink in more of the Backrooms
essence, and soon it was beginning to reshape

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:30.850
the liminal abyss itself.

00:10:30.850 --> 00:10:34.640
Countless entities were nothing more than
cannon fodder to the unstoppable machine of

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:37.620
destruction that 682 had become.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:44.490
As foe after foe fell prey to Entity 682 - master
of the backrooms - more of the other levels

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:48.490
began to disappear as they were absorbed into
Level 682.

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:53.960
The reptile was on a violent spree at this
point, and could almost imagine itself back

00:10:53.960 --> 00:10:59.450
at the foundation, painting the walls with
mobile task force agents and researchers alike.

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:06.589
In its frenzy, SCP-682 found itself once again
face-to-face with the Plush Dino of Level

00:11:06.589 --> 00:11:07.589
18.

00:11:07.589 --> 00:11:13.700
The despised Entity 198 who served as a guide
for lost and distressed souls, and had once

00:11:13.700 --> 00:11:18.870
regarded SCP-682 as the most tormented being
in existence.

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:23.649
Even now, the Plush Dino’s instinct to reach
out to those suffering from terrible anguish

00:11:23.649 --> 00:11:27.220
had guided it to the new and improved 682.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:35.210
682 had always disliked 198, and was especially
resentful that it had chosen to appear now.

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:39.970
Did its presence mean that deep inside, 682
was still suffering from the scars of its

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:40.970
past?

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:41.970
No.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.340
I have overcome that.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.340
Adapted.

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:46.440
I always do.

00:11:46.440 --> 00:11:51.899
682 stepped forward as if to consume its next
victim, but a nagging feeling stopped it from

00:11:51.899 --> 00:11:53.220
committing to the attack.

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:57.890
If it were to devour the plush dino there
was a possibility that it would also consume

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:03.639
Level 18, a subjective realm that would always
transform to recreate the childhood traumas

00:12:03.639 --> 00:12:05.839
of the explorer inside of it.

00:12:05.839 --> 00:12:10.300
682 had not been afraid to face its traumatic
past during its journey through the earlier

00:12:10.300 --> 00:12:15.459
layers of the backroom, but to make the echo
of those painful memories a permanent part

00:12:15.459 --> 00:12:18.960
of its form seemed to be a bridge too far.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.160
Besides…

00:12:20.160 --> 00:12:22.899
What would Jerry think of me?

00:12:22.899 --> 00:12:27.089
SCP-682 caught itself thinking of Entity 7
again.

00:12:27.089 --> 00:12:33.019
It was frozen with indecision, unsure whether
or not to devour Entity 198 on the spot.

00:12:33.019 --> 00:12:39.310
Then, a sudden blaze of scorching flames snapped
682 back to the present moment.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:43.940
This gasp of the inferno caused the plush
dino to turn tail and move to a different

00:12:43.940 --> 00:12:49.700
level of the backrooms. 682 was now surrounded
by fire at some distant level that it had

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.690
never seen before.

00:12:51.690 --> 00:12:56.680
On the horizon stood a vast army of flaming
beings, glowing with a solar light that gave

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:59.100
off an unbelievable amount of heat.

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:04.760
Presiding above all others in this militant
fire army was the apparent leader, a six-armed

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:10.560
bright red humanoid whose regal features were
as imposing as the halos of sunflare that

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:12.750
adorned his fingertips.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:19.810
This unfathomable being would soon be 682’s
latest and, thus far, greatest challenger.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:27.000
He was a legend of the backrooms and the true
ruler of the warlike dimension of Level 966

00:13:27.000 --> 00:13:28.389
- the inferno.

00:13:28.389 --> 00:13:34.209
An ancient god whose relentless forest-fires
had chased Lord Wormwood and his tree people

00:13:34.209 --> 00:13:36.220
to the brink of extinction.

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:42.180
The forgemaster who pulled the flame-o’-the-golden
from the all-brilliance and made it his source

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:43.269
of power.

00:13:43.269 --> 00:13:49.399
This was Rajarahan the Golden Kindle, Prince
of Fires of Light.

00:13:49.399 --> 00:13:52.310
“Oh, Great Beast of Level 682.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:58.550
I, Rajarahan, have heard the tales of your
glorious conquest throughout the liminal spaces

00:13:58.550 --> 00:14:00.329
of these Backrooms.

00:14:00.329 --> 00:14:05.750
I have heard that you hail from the Front
Rooms and are the uncontested strongest being

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:07.600
from that reality.

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:14.190
I am here to answer your summons and per your
request for a challenge - see which of us

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:15.959
is the greater.”

00:14:15.959 --> 00:14:20.970
The Prince of Fires moved his hands and cast
forth a merciless conflagration of stellar

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:21.970
flame.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:28.459
682 was bathed in the fury of a thousand suns
and felt an unthinkable rush of pain, unlike

00:14:28.459 --> 00:14:31.060
even the sword of the guardian from back home.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:36.269
The fires continued to lick its form as 682
went berserk and charged towards the armies

00:14:36.269 --> 00:14:37.720
of Rajarahan.

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:43.519
Quick as the spark of an ignited flame, Rajarahan
intercepted 682 and delivered a punishing

00:14:43.519 --> 00:14:45.920
kick to the lizard’s spine.

00:14:45.920 --> 00:14:50.529
Fire swirled around the prince’s limbs,
transforming into burning weapons.

00:14:50.529 --> 00:14:54.209
“Do not think your quarrel is with my army.”

00:14:54.209 --> 00:14:55.620
The prince said flatly.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.660
“They are here to watch.”

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:03.710
Rajarahan swung all six of his muscular limbs,
striking away at 682 with the divine weapons

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:05.009
held in each.

00:15:05.009 --> 00:15:10.730
682 cried out in agony, swinging a claw back
at the prince, and leaving a cut across the

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:12.510
regal being's face.

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:16.899
The reptile then stole a page from its fallen
adversaries and transformed its tail into

00:15:16.899 --> 00:15:21.790
an unbreakable spear, striking Rajarahan with
a swift attack.

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:22.850
“Magnificent!”

00:15:22.850 --> 00:15:24.980
Rajarahan smiled.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:30.800
The battle raged on for several hours, with
both entities taking severe damage and continuing

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:35.829
to fight even as their bodies were wounded
with the sheer force of all the attacks given

00:15:35.829 --> 00:15:37.190
and received.

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:43.089
As it dragged on, Rajarahan revealed even
greater reserves of solaric power than 682

00:15:43.089 --> 00:15:44.240
could have believed.

00:15:44.240 --> 00:15:50.010
Likewise, 682’s strength continued to rise
as the reptile acclimated to its ungodly strong

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:51.339
opponent.

00:15:51.339 --> 00:15:56.730
Several times, 682’s body was burned entirely
to atomic ash, but was able to regenerate

00:15:56.730 --> 00:16:00.990
and continue the struggle against the Prince
of Fire and Light.

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:03.810
It was much later when Rajarahan fell.

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:08.899
The noble golden kindle had a smile on his
face, an eternal acknowledgement that the

00:16:08.899 --> 00:16:12.910
opponent he had faced was one truly worthy
of killing him.

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.800
“Well fought, Lord of 682.

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:19.069
I bequeath my army to you.

00:16:19.069 --> 00:16:22.570
Rule the Back Rooms in my stead.”

00:16:22.570 --> 00:16:30.010
As his essence burned to cinders, the forces
of level 966 bowed their heads to 682 - a

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:33.410
backrooms legend to destroy all backroom’s
legends.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:39.420
Now go check out “SCP-018 - Can the Super
Ball Defeat SCP-682?”

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:42.639
and “Was SCP-682 Really That Hard to Kill
After All?” for more!

